## Markup skeleton

```html
<link rel="stylesheet" href="…/css/fce-vocab-word-box.css" />
<body class="vocab-wordbox-page">
  <div class="vocab-bank-workspace">
    <div class="vocab-bank-main">
      <p class="vocab-wordbox-hint">Click a gap, then a word on the right…</p>
      <div id="sentences"></div>
    </div>
    <aside class="vocab-bank-rail" aria-label="Word box">
      <div class="vocab-bank" id="word-bank"></div>
    </aside>
  </div>
</body>
```

## Don’t

- Word box as a **horizontal band above** the task (old anti-pattern).
- Bank on the **left** for FCE gap-fill (CPE Unit 12 collocations may differ).
- Tiny chips (`0.78rem`) or giant sentence text.
- Nested scroll on the sentence column just to “fit” the bank — widen page to `min(980px)` via `.vocab-wordbox-page .page`.

